1. Based on CollegePlanner
--------------------------

usos-planner is a Python rewrite and extension of CollegePlanner by
Jan Rutecki (GitHub: rutek6), https://github.com/rutek6/CollegePlanner,
a C++ schedule planner with a Python helper for USOSweb timetables.

No CollegePlanner source code is copied into this repository. What
usos-planner takes from it:

  * the `.in` timetable format (PRZEDMIOT / ZAJECIA / GRUPA) and the
    `prefs.in` preference keys, kept compatible so existing files work
    (usos_planner/inputs/text_format.py);
  * the penalty model for schedules: hard and soft conflicts, time spent at
    university, late ends and early starts (usos_planner/solver.py);
  * the idea of reading groups from a saved USOSweb page, rewritten from
    its parser.py (usos_planner/inputs/usosweb_html.py).

At the time of writing the CollegePlanner repository has no license file.
All credit for the original design belongs to its author.


