3. External services
--------------------

usos-planner talks to services it does not own. Using them is subject to
their own terms:

  * the USOS API of your university (https://<usos-api>/developers/), run
    by the university and the MUCI consortium;
  * the Google Calendar API, under the Google APIs Terms of Service.

USOS, USOSweb and Google Calendar are names of their respective owners;
usos-planner is an independent project and is not endorsed by them.
